==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|appropinquare|t=to approach}}, present active infinitive of {{l|la|appropinquo|appropinquō}}, from {{l|la|ad-}} ("towards") + {{l|la|propinquo|propinquō}} (“draw near”), verbalization of propinquus (“near”); compare {{l|la|prope}} ("near").

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

